  "short_name": "Answer Key",
  "description": "Eleven subjects for the SSC track, index first. The recall half: the eight classical dances and the folk dances of every state, the festivals and fairs, Ancient and Medieval India, the three new criminal laws — BNS, BNSS and BSA — by section number, Geography built around the Himalayas, and Centre-State relations with the Seventh Schedule. The maths half as questions with the formula in the explanation: algebra, geometry with drawn figures, mensuration in two and three dimensions, trigonometry with the whole of height and distance, and profit, loss and mixture. Works offline.",
